/-!
The Lanes API: everything an application's executable code needs, and the tools its proofs use.
It imports only `Std`, so binaries stay small. It leaves out the services (`Lanes.Services`) and
CBOR (`Lanes.Lib.Encoding.Cbor`): an application imports the ones it uses, such as
`Lanes.Services.Postgres`. The framework's own
soundness theorems are `Lanes.Proofs`, and the proof layer is `Lanes.Semantics`.
-/
